+/**
+ * Views reading through one feed. Any view's read is authoritative for the others, so a view
+ * whose accepted data a sibling's read proves behind reads again; otherwise a view confirmed at
+ * the handshake keeps stale data with no warning when a hint is missed. Only settled views are
+ * asked, so failed views keep their bounded recovery and moving heads cannot ping-pong reads.
+ * The feed already tracks every watch's heads and should own this; it lives here because the
+ * feed ships in the provenance-pinned framework bundle.
+ */
+type Sibling = {
